      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "STICKY MANGO (8) is yet to break through in eight starts but has run a number of placings. Hit the frame again last start finishing third (17.71) at Murray Bridge Straight. Deserves serious consideration. LADY LATTE (1) steps out for the first time at this track. In the money last start when second (19.79) at Angle Park over 342m. Will give a great sight again. PAMELA JUNE (6) showed little early speed at her last couple, the latest finishing fourth (20.38) in a Maiden at Angle Park. A big run wouldn't surprise. LET'S GO MONTY (4) is a newcomer from the John Rees kennel. No favours with the draw and will need to begin well. Can sneak into the frame with the right run.",
